<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:43 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt">Ê-phê-sô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Phao-lô, Khơl jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu vii iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, atăq ka khơl vah, laa khơl tuôq măn aduq Ê-phê-sô ji laa khơl adro muuyq xuum đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, ji Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, truh tol oh ay.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Đangq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, Vaq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, laa Kơy heq apôôt vanong ka haay dii tôôy vanong danưng kooy măn kaluh aduq tol plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />kung đaji Kadraq heq rơơlh haay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xing adroyq tuôôy panưk pajêêk play vari, xôq haay jah yuôôr vah ji leh e aduq xôq đnooy ik kangưưr Kadraq. Vii xuum xung xiaq <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Kadraq heq đinq adroyq haay xôq dơơp koot văch ku Kadraq gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, tyauq varơuq hlah xuum ku iq trôôch Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />xôq vlôh play bơơn varơuq ayuôôt laat tađnah tađnaak ku vanong plêêk Kadraq đơu Kadraq heq ranưh ranơơy kahniq ăm ka haay đom Koot Xung Xiaq ku Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />đơu đom Koot nưq, haay e varơuq wơơt bla gamưh vahaap Kadraq, varơuq tha ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh tyauq varơuq karoh e ku vanong plêêk Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />laa vanong plêêk đơu Kadraq heq kahniq ăm ka haay kach raah jôôh đom tôôy varơuq khôôt xet ji hlolh xet, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />khienq ka haay nhonq xet varơuq kadook ku xuum trôôch Kadraq tyauq varơuq hlah xuum Kadraq, laa varơuq đơu Kadraq heq ralauq xôq xing droyq đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />xôq tuôôy truh kawah đinq jah payôôch ka varơuq heq đinq xôq, yôôych anguk tagumq tôôy paroh hlê đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, kung kaluh paroh tol plêêk hloay kaluh paroh 'laarq vari, đom Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />nưq laa đom Kơy đơu haay kung jah ahlook phon kơ ngiip, vii heq jah đinq adroyq tyauq ka iq ku Kơy dơơp yuôôr tôôy varơuq dang đaji ka varơuq ku iq trôôch Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />xôq ka haay, khơl ado adroyq dik xôq xuum takôô gamưh aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, jah raak play bơơn varơuq ayuôôt laat truh tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Laay kung đom Kadraq, atêq tuôôy tameng đaauq ku varơuq dik, laa Hêêl Kaxay truh varơuq wơơt bla oh ay, ji tuôôy heq tuôq aduq Kadraq, yôôych oh ay heq jah dơơp hlêêl bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel tyauq apok tavek, <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />đơu Kơy nưq laa varơuq dơơp xanưk truh kơ ngiip ku haay dong truh tuôôy root bla dêq hloay kơ ngiip, xôq raak play bơơn varơuq ayuôôt laat truh tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Vii anưq, xing ka tuôôy gô tameng truh xuum tuôq ku oh ay đom Lôôk, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, ji xung xiaq deng ka dêq hloay ka khơl vah, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />yôôych gô leh padơy tưp apok kuh kway vii oh ay, văch truh oh ay đom apok apôôy ku gô, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />xôq ka Kơy Plêêk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, laa Vaq tađnah tađnaak, hnoq kahniq ka oh ay yaak ku varơuq khôôt xet ji varơuq kahnoq tauq đom varơuq nhonq xet Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />khienq kalook mot ku xuum oh ay jah ahnhe tađnah, xôq oh ay xet xuum takôô gamưh truh varơuq tawooyh taayh ku Kadraq laa kajoq, varơuq karoh e ku Kơ ngiip tađnah tađnaak Kadraq đom khơl vah luleq, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ji varơuq kôt lơyq leh kajoq taso ku taay yaak Kadraq laa luleq đôôyq dii haay, laa khơl adro e xuum tuôq, tyauq varơuq dưk dơơp xing paraat kalh taay yaak ku Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />đơu Kadraq heq dưk dơơp đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh tuôôy khienq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê ji xôq 'ngôôy pi akoh Kadraq măn kaluh aduq tol plêêk, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />galơh iaq tol tôôy khơl dưk xanok, qwuyen da uh, taay yaak, ji chuh qwuyen, kung tôôy anơng taayh jah atok yal, leh vơ đom đơơy neq đơu hloay đom đơơy jeq truh đnoyq. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Kadraq heq khienq tôôy paroh kuh kul 'laarq jôôk Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji xôq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh dơơp akoq măn ataalh tôôy varơuq đôôyq dii tayuup vah, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />đơu tayuup vah laa xăk xamơk Kadraq, laa varơuq xaleep ku Kơy dơơp xaleep tôôy varơuq đom tôôy paroh.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Măn phon oh ay, laa adro kaxêêt đom kaluh gưlh lôp ji kadrôôp maroh oh ay, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />laa đom kaluh varơuq đơu tuôôy droyq, oh ay heq xa măn tyauq trôôk hoot ku dêh araak neq, tyauq adro dưk xanok dii qwuyen da uh aduq kawah, laa garu xi juneq đong dưk dơơp đom êêp koot xau leh tameng tyauq, <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />đơu adroyq hơq, măn katul oot, dêq hloay haay kung heq riirh đom kaluh xuum hmưch ku xăk xamơk haay, dưk dơơp kaluh hmưch trôôch ku xăk xamơk ji xuum biit. Tyauq xuum klaak đơơy neq, haay 'miêh laa koot xau ku varơuq tôq dayh kung đaji tôôy dro kadrơy. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk, laa Kơy karoh xuum biit angơuq, vii xung xiaq kôt lơyq ku Kadraq đơu Kadraq heq xiaq haay, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />lunưq tuôôy haay laa khơl adro kaxêêt đom kaluh gưlh lôp haay, yôôych Kadraq heq khienq haay kung riirh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh — nưq laa gamưh vanong plêêk đơu oh ay heq jah Wơơt — <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kadraq khienq haay kung riirh hlê, ji xôq 'ngôôy kung dii Kadraq măn kaluh aduq tol plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />xôq đom kaluh đơơy xanưm jeq truh, Kadraq hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh varơuq karoh e ranưh ranơơy ku vanong plêêk Kadraq gamưh varơuq hwêêt xuum đôôyq dii haay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Vii xing vanong plêêk, oh ay jah wơơt gamưh xuum tuôq, varơuq neq leh e vlôh xing oh ay, đơu laa kadrool ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />be aalq vlôh xing kaluh varơuq dơơp, xôq leh muuyq dro leq hnoq ik pa ưưt akhwoak. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Vii haay laa varơuq dơơp ku Kadraq, jah panưk pajêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu ka kaluh varơuq kaxay đơu Kơy Plêêk heq ralauq xôq adroyq xôq haay hnoq ik riirh đom kaluh varơuq nưq.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kơq nưq, dayh văch đaneq adroyq neq, oh ay laa tamooy daak kadrơy đom xăk xamơk, tamooy biq taayh laa “koq chiuq goch kađuh” vii tamooy jah taayh laa “heq jah goch kađuh” đom xăk xamơk, muuyq varơuq dơơp xing ti koot manih dưk dơơp, <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />vii tuôôy nưq, oh ay 'miêh biq aklah đêh dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, tuôôy biq xôq pi gôk manih karôp I-sơ-ra-ên, ji 'miêh laa tamooy xadaay đôôyq dii kaluh apok tavek ku apok tavek, lunưq be e takôô gamưh, kung leh e Kơy Plêêk đom dêh araak neq. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Bơh, đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, oh ay, khơl adro tuôôy adroyq 'miêh xangưưy, juneq heq jah taway truh jeq gamưh vahaap ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Vii kadih Kadraq laa varơuq tagu hlê ku haay, laa Kơy heq dơơp ka dêq vaarq vlôh jêêk muuyq ji pahyaak ka'lăk apưt ku varơuq aklah ahlook, nưq laa varơuq tachơơl hlê, đom xăk xamơk Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />tuôôy heq ka'lăk ganuun ku kaluh ganeen đom kaluh qwi đinq, xôq ka Kadraq hnoq ik khienq ka dêq vaarq vlôh jêêk muuyq dro đơơu đom Kadraq, dơơp vlôh tagu hlê, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />ji xôq Kadraq hnoq ik dơơp tagu hlê dêq vaarq dii Kơy Plêêk đom muuyq xăk xamơk gamưh gay charăk, atêq tuôôy păk kaxêêt varơuq tachơơl hlê tol nưq. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Tuôôy Kadraq heq truh, Kadraq padoh taboon varơuq tagu hlê ka oh ay, laa khơl adro măn xangưưy, ji varơuq tagu hlê ka khơl adro măn jeq, <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />vii gamưh Kadraq, dêq vaarq e qwuyen tawaak truh jeq đom muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel xôq truh dii Vaq. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Đanưq, oh ay be măn laa tamooy xadaay long manih daak kadrơy đnoyq. Tađôôy muut đnư, oh ay laa manih kung dêh katu dii khơl vah ji laa muuyq dro đom kôôch hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />vii heq jah xơy panưk tol kahnier ku khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl hnhư hlit, tuôôy jơq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu laa phơu muum hnhư, <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />đơu đom Kadraq, kaah varơuq dơơp xơy panưk, tuôôy jah tabôk dii mamuuyq, yôôych vlôh jêêk muuyq hnhư hơu vah đom Lôôk, <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />ji kung đom Kadraq, oh ay jah tagumq kung dii mamuuyq jêêk aduq măn ku Kơy Plêêk đom Kơy Phool Hiel.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Vii kakơq nưq, gô, Phao-lô, laa adro karuk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu vii kơq oh ay tamooy daak kadrơy — <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />vii dik laa oh ay heq tameng truh varơuq jư 'yo vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq heq jah pahnăp ka gô vii oh ay, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />tyauq varơuq kahnoq vlôh heq jah kahnoq ka gô, nưq laa varơuq kadook đaji gô heq valơk kach axit hlê neq. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Tuôôy đok truh varơuq nưq, oh ay hnoq ik nhonq vlôh varơuq xet hlolh ku gô truh varơuq kadook ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />laa varơuq heq leh jah kahnoq vlôh ka koot xau koot manih đom adrơơk koot xau adroyq, đom tuôôy juneq, vii Kơy Phool Hiel, varơuq nưq heq jah kahnoq ka khơl jah rơơlh vah ku Kadraq kung khơl hlit — <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />nưq laa: khơl tamooy kadrơy laa adro kung dưk hlê, laa kaluh chi thêêh đom kung muuyq xăk, ji laa khơl adro kung ahlook apok tavek đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu gamưh hlê Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />vii Hêêl Kaxay nưq đơu gô heq jah vlôh jêêk muuyq xapok gamưh tol kadrool vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq heq jah kahniq ka gô tyauq varơuq dưk dơơp ku taay yaak Kadraq. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Vanong plêêk nưq heq jah kahniq ka gô — adro de dik đom dêq hloay khơl vah — xôq padoh taboon ka khơl tamooy kadrơy varơuq karoh e leh hlolh ik ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />ji xôq dơơp ăm hloq hlolh ka tôôy dro leq laa varơuq jư 'yo varơuq kadook, laa varơuq heq jah kadook padu dalơh hlê kaluh đơơy xanưm đom Kơy Plêêk, Kơy panưk pajêêk tôôy paroh, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />xôq ka juneq, gamưh tayuup vah, varơuq khôôt xet tôôy trôôk ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq ik kahnoq vlôh ka khơl kơy dưk xanok ji khơl băk qwuyen da uh măn kaluh aduq tol plêêk, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />tyauq iq đinq đơơy đơơy đơu Kadraq heq payôôch đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />đơu đom Kơy nưq, haay e xuum kôk kalh ji trôôk hooy truh jeq Kơy Plêêk dii varơuq be huq yôq gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Lunưq, gô xiin oh ay te ravoch xuum xing kaluh pơơl dal ku gô vii kơq oh ay, đơu kaluh pơơl dal nưq laa varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku oh ay.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Vii kakơq nưq, gô kul takuul kangưưr Vaq, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />laa Kơy đơu xing Kadraq, tôôy adrơơk tol plêêk ji 'laarq vari jah taayh anơng, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />xôq xiin Kadraq, tyauq varơuq karoh e ku tađnah tađnaak Kadraq, khienq oh ay jah kalh paraat dii taay yaak gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kadraq aduq koot manih pi'lăp, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />xôq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn đom xuum oh ay gamưh hlê xuum tuôq, tuôôy heq jah vlok rayah ji kajưk kahnier đom xung xiaq, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />xôq ka oh ay kung dii dêq hloay khơl vah, e đuh paraat xôq hlolh xet đaji luleq laa ranưh, yơơt, yơơt atok, jaruq, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />ji xôq nhonq vlôh varơuq galơh iaq varơuq hlolh xet, nưq laa xung xiaq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq ka oh ay jah uk viik bơơn tôôy varơuq viik xaleep ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Xiin wih xuq Kơy hnoq ik dưk dơơp galơh iaq tôôy varơuq đơu haay apôôy vôôch long biit truh, tyauq taay yaak đong dưk dơơp đom haay, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />apôôy Kadraq jah tađnah tađnaak đom tayuup vah ji đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu dalơh hlê tôôy adrơơk đơơy đơơy hloay hloay. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Lunưq, gô, adro karuk đom Lôôk, ahmưk nhăk oh ay pheq riirh trôôk xưngq đangq dii varơuq tawooyh taayh đơu oh ay heq jah taayh truh, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />bơơn dêq hloay varơuq apôôt xăk ji be huq, kung dii atuq xuum, chiuq uunq mamuuyq đom xuum xung xiaq, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />paraanq dêq paraat xôq jư varơuq tagumq muuyq ku Kơy Phool Hiel đom thơơl taboot tagu hlê. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Vơ muuyq xăk xamơk ji muuyq Kơy Phool Hiel, kung đaji oh ay heq jah taayh truh muuyq xuum takôô gamưh đom varơuq tawooyh taayh ku oh ay, <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />vơ muuyq Lôôk, muuyq xuum tuôq, muuyq pheep bap-tem, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />vơ muuyq Kơy Plêêk, Vaq ku tôôy dro, Kơy măn ataalh tôôy dro, katul tôôy dro ji đom tôôy dro. <verse eid="EPH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Bơh, vanong plêêk heq jah kahniq ka tôôy dro muuyq đom haay tyauq kamưk đom varơuq kahniq ăm ku Kơy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Kơq nưq, e apok valơk:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Tuôôy Kadraq 'ngôôy tol kaluh aduq yơơt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Kadraq hooy adroyq jarooy tyauq bing xapok,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">ji kahniq 'ngưng kadrool ka koot manih.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Lunư, “Kadraq 'ngôôy tok” iq laa kajoq atoh leh aalq laa Kadraq kung heq pôôt truh kaluh aduq lêq ku vari? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Jơq Kơy heq pôôt kung laa Kơy heq 'ngôôy tok yơơt iaq dêq hloay kaluh tal plêêk, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik dơơp galơh galaay tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Jơq Kadraq heq xôq muuyq sôôq dơơp khơl jah rơơlh, muuyq sôôq dơơp hnhư hlit, muuyq sôôq dơơp hnhư padoh pato Hêêl Kaxay, muuyq sôôq dơơp muk sư ji thơy pato, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />xôq taway truh varơuq ralauq xôq khơl vah ka varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq, wih truh varơuq rôôk tok xăk xamơk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />dong truh tuôôy dêq hloay haay varơyh truh varơuq tagumq muuyq đom xuum tuôq ji varơuq hlolh xet Koot Kơy Plêêk, vlôh jêêk dro kôt xet, varơyh truh kaphook xăk xaleep ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />xôq haay paq măn laa on oh, biq taluq talek ji hwoa hoot tyauq tôôy ngưưr khiel pato dayq vii xuum 'moh ku khơl kadrơy gamưh xuum xôq vih dii varơuq pa ôôh, xơk lar. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Tađôôy muut đnư, tuôôy đnooy vlôh varơuq dik đom xuum xung xiaq, haay hnoq ik kôt tok đom tôôy panưh wih truh Kadraq, Kơy laa akoq, nưq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />xing aduq Kadraq đơu dêq xăk xamơk jah tagumq hlê ji tabôk hlê dii mamuuyq gamưh tôôy thơơl tabôk vek waak, tyauq đaji kamưk dơơp đom tôôy muuyq bôq phânq, dơơp ka xăk xamơk kôt tok xôq kadih rôôk tok đom xuum xung xiaq.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Kơq nưq, gô đnooy varơuq neq ji ahmưk nhăk oh ay đom Lôôk xôq paq măn xa măn dang đaji tamooy kadrơy đnoyq, oot riirh đom varơuq hư hlơơp ku xuum biit oot. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Vii xuum biit oot heq biq dơơp kamơng jaluk, vlôh jêêk đêh xangưưy dii varơuq riirh ku Kơy Plêêk vii varơuq vlô apoop măn đom oot, vii xuum oot găk khăk. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Tuôôy vlôh jêêk paq măn xet biit kajoq, oot ka'lăk xăk oot muut đom varơuq xagưt xôq lôp tôôy varơuq klơơr 'yêq dii xuum hmưch trôôch. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Bơh oh ay heq leh hok xet Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đanưq, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />vii dik laa oh ay heq tameng truh Kadraq ji heq jah pato dayq đom Kadraq, tyauq đaji varơuq dik măn đom Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />đaneq pheq leh ka'lăk klơlh oh ay kaluh kajoq thuôk xuq đơơy riirh adroyq neq, nưq laa koot manih duut biq hư hlơơp vii xuum hmưch xơk lar, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />đơu jah dơơp vlôh đơu gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel đom xuum biit oh ay, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />ji hlưp muut koot manih đơơu, laa manih jah panưk jêêk tyauq Kơy Plêêk — đom varơuq hyioh jăk ji varơuq vah xarêh ku varơuq dik.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Đanưq, tuôôy heq ka'lăk varơuq pa ôôh lar, tôôy dro pheq đnooy varơuq dong dik dii manih gah gih oh ay, vii kơq haay laa chi thêêh ku mamuuyq. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Oh ay ik tôq jaraq đơu leh lôp kadrôôp. Dayh xôq mot hngơy leh lôp tol varơuq dơơp jaraq oh ay, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />kung te xôq kawah leq ka kamuuych. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Dro atôk te atôk đnoyq. Bơh, tolh iaq, dro nưq pheq raanq paraat dơơp varơuq tamaq kaxay bơơn kadih ti ni, xôq ka dro nưq e tuôông kajoq xôq ahlook ăm dii dro leq đong măn đom tuôôy pangoot hrah. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Te xôq apok đnooy xơk 'moh leq đnooy vlôh xing huuy oh ay, đơu dayh đnooy kaluh apok leq tolh kaxay jarooy truh varơuq rôôk tơơk dro leq đom tuôôy pơơl hwơơl, xôq apok nưq hnoq ik taway vanong ka dro tameng, <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />ji te dơơp hlu Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk, vii Kadraq đơu oh ay jah dơơp dơuq ka hngơy wơơt bla. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Dayh ka'lăk klơlh oh ay dêq hloay jiq xuum, tôq xuum, tôq jaraq, tayaat, đnooy ra ơơh, kung tôôy varơuq xơk tauq. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Tađôôy muut đnư, dayh kahnoq vlôh ka mamuuyq xuum hwêêt, xuum angơuq, ka'lăk ka mamuuyq kung đaji Kơy Plêêk heq ka'lăk ka oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Anưq, dayh vlôh jêêk khơl dro dơơp atôôlh tyauq Kơy Plêêk, đaji koot xau thier jah xung xiaq ku Kadraq, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />ji dayh riirh đom xung xiaq, kung đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq xiaq haay ji chiuq kaxêêt kadih Kadraq vii haay đaji muuyq kuah lêh ji kuah tưp dii muuy thơơm rahuut tơơk tưp tok Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Măn varơuq apuq atrăp, kung tôôy varơuq be vah long hmưch trôôch yôôych pheq đnooy te liq nhăk truh đom katul oh ay, đaji varơuq nưq laa tamuut dii khơl vah, <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />kung te đnooy apok hôônh, apok leh yuôôr aal, long apok tache agưt leh xaay — laa kaluh thưq leh tamuut — đơu tađôôy muut đnư bơơn apok kuh kway. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Dik anưq, dayh xet varơuq neq dong kajưk đaneq tôôy dro apuq atrăp, be vah, long hmưch trôôch — nưq laa adro kuh kway vangưl — raay leh e kơ ngiip đom daak dêh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Te xôq kơyq aluut pa ôôh oh ay bơơn kaluh apok đnooy leh yuôôr aal, vii bơyh kaluh varơuq nưq, đơơt tôq dayq ku Kơy Plêêk tôh pôôt tol khơl koot xau leh dơơp tyauq. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Lunưq, oh ay te vlôh jêêk khơl adro jưq phon dii oot, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />vii adroyq hơq oh ay măn kamơng jaluk, bơh juneq laa xaraar tađnah đom Lôôk. Dayh xa măn đaji koot xau ku xaraar tađnah <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(vii raak play ku xaraar tađnah măn katul tôôy varơuq tamaq kaxay, hyioh jăk, ji dong dik), <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />tuôôy rơơt rol 'yo hlê 'leq laa varơuq kaxay xuum Lôôk. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Te jưq phon muut kaluh varơuq be e ich ku varơuq kamơng jaluk, bơh dayh kahnoq oot vlôh măn iaq, <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />vii dik laa kamưưl tuôôy vơ nhăk truh kaluh varơuq oot dưk dơơp kach padu kadook. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Bơh tôôy paroh jah hloq ro tuôôy jah kahnoq vlôh bơyh xaraar tađnah, vii tôôy paroh jah hloq ro raay laa xaraar tađnah. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Kơq nưq, e apok xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Dayh kadrăch kah, nee adro đong vik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">dayh dưk tok xing đom bing manih kaxêêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq ahnhe tađnah xăk.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Lunưq, dayh văch 'yo rơơt rol kach oh ay đong xa măn — te đaji adro vlô apoop bơh đaji manih khôôt xet, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />tuôôy dayh alay kawat, vii kaluh hngơy laa xơuq. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Vii anưq, te vlôh jêêk adro vlô apoop, bơh pheq hlolh leq laa iq trôôch ku Lôôk. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Te vuul lok, vii varơuq nưq laa bơyq ba. Wih hlê, dayh ik galơh galaay dii Kơy Phool Hiel, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />tơơl hlê dii mamuuyq bơơn thi thiên, kacheeu vah ji baai kacheeu thiêêng liêng, dii xuum klaak haay kacheeu ayuôôt ji vanê ayuôôt Lôôk, <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />tưp apok kuh kway Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, đom tôôy tuôôy truh tôôy varơuq taayh yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />ji tameng mamuuyq đom varơuq 'yo yôq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh —<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Dro dơơp kadrê, pheq tameng kanau ni đaji tameng Lôôk. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Vii kanau laa akoq kadrê, kung đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa akoq tayuup vah — jơq Kadraq laa Wơơt Lôôk ku xăk xamơk. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Lunư, tayuup vah tameng tyauq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh luleq yôôych kadrê kung tameng tyauq kanau ni đom tôôy varơuq lunưq. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Adro dơơp kanau, dayh xiaq kadrê ni, kung đaji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq xiaq tayuup vah ji chiuq kaxêêt kadih xăk vii tayuup vah, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />xôq Kadraq hnoq ik tađôôy đơơu tayuup nưq, atêq tuôôy dơơp ăm paxa rêh bơơn varơuq 'nhaau xarêh ku daak kung dii apok đaauq, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />xôq ka Kadraq taway kahnoq vlôh ka kadih kadraq muuyq tayuup vah tađnah tađnaak, leh e a'moh mơy long jah ka'lăk kadrôôp, long paq kê varơuq leq lunưq, bơh xôq tayuup jah vah xarêh ji leh aduq xôq đnooy ik. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Tyauq kach lunưq yôôych kanau kung pheq xiaq kadrê ni đaji kadih xăk ni. Dro kanau xiaq kadrê ku ni laa xiaq kadih ni. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Vii be kơyq 'yarơ xăk ni dong leq, bơh văch xiap ji jư 'yo ni, kung đaji kach Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đôôyq dii tayuup vah, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />vii haay laa kaluh chi thêêh ku xăk Kadraq. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Vii ka kơq nưq, khơl kanau hnoq aklah vlôh miq vaq ji hnoq jah pajêêk dii kadrê ni, dêq baarq hnoq vlôh jêêk muuyq xăk.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Varơuq kadook neq thier kôt lơyq — bơh gô đong đnooy truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ji truh tayuup vah. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Long anưq, oh ay kung tyauq trôôk nưq — tưng dro muuyq — tôôy dro kanau pheq xiaq kadrê ni đaji kadih ni, măn dro kadrê nưq laa duh 'yo kul kanau ni.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Dro dơơp koot, dayh tameng apok miq vaq ku êêp koot đom Lôôk, vii nưq laa varơuq 'yo jơq. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Dayh dêq xuum xung miq vaq ku koot” (nưq laa ganeen adroyq dik ji xatyauq apok tavek), <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“xôq vanong kaxay truh dii koot ji koot hnoq ik jah riirh xiik tol vari.” <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Dro dơơp vaq, te tache jaraq koot xau haay. Tađôôy muut đnư, dayh văch xiap oot đom varơuq 'meq dook ji jarooy pato ku Lôôk.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Dro dơơp xapok, dayh tameng tyauq dro kôôch tyauq phon xăk xamơk dii varơuq 'yo kul ji vadrau yôq aduq xuum dong dik ku haay, dang đaji đôôyq dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />leh aalq dii kiêuh hơu varơuq tuôôy kôôch dưk 'yo đaji khơl adro trôôch xok xuum, bơh đaji xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, dưk dơơp iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk bơơn dêq xuum phool, <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />tameng tyauq dii xuum hlah hlaak, đaji hơu varơuq ka Lôôk đơu leh aalq ka khơl kadrơy, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />vii xet đaneq tôôy dro, ju xapok long rayơh rayơơy, atoh dơơp varơuq kaxay leq, yôôych dro nưq hnoq nhonq varơuq dang anưq xing aduq Lôôk.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Ji, adro dơơp kôôch, pheq xa dơơp kung kach nưq dii khơl xapok, tuôôy padơy varơuq kata naap, vii xet đaneq Kôôch Hnhư vơơ ku oot vơơ ku oh ay đong măn tol plêêk, ji leh e varơuq bing kơyq aduq Kadraq.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Atêq dik, dayh jah dơơp ăm kalh paraat đom Lôôk, ji đom paraat kalh taay yaak ku Kadraq. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Dayh hlưp muut dêq hloay aau jaap ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq dơơp ka oh ay hnoq ik dưk kajưk, tachơơl hlê kaluh xôq vih ku kamuuych. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Vii đơơt tahmơt ku haay leh aalq laa tachơơl dii vahaap ji xăk xamơk, bơh laa tachơơl hlê khơl adro xakaq, tachơơl hlê kaluh hnhư adrơk qwuyen da uh, tachơơl hlê khơl băk dưk xanok dêh araak kamơng jaluk neq, tachơơl hlê kaluh garu xi măn kaluh aduq tol plêêk. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Vii kơq nưq, dayh hlưp muut dêq hloay aau jaap ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq oh ay hnoq ik tachơơl hlê đom hngơy xơk aak, ji dưk kajưk atêq tuôôy payôôch tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Lunưq, dayh dưk kajưk, tuôôy hnek talơy katêêk ku oh ay bơơn varơuq dik, hlưp xok aau jaap ku varơuq hyioh jăk, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />troaq muut jôôk varơuq ralauq adroyq ku Hêêl Kaxay hrok hrol, <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />tơơk tok tômq khêêl ku xuum tuôq đom tôôy varơuq, vii nưq đơu oh ay hnoq ik kajôp poch tôôy nook ôôlh ku adro xơk. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Dayh yil đoat jaap wơơt xok ji xieh Kơy Phool Hiel, đơu nưq laa apok ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />tuôôy apôôy tôôy kawah đom Kơy Phool Hiel gamưh hlê tôôy apok apôôy vôôch ji ratuut vôôch, ji wih truh raak play đom tuôôy kah parol bơơn dêq hloay varơuq atuq xuum ji varơuq apôôy thay deng ka dêq hloay khơl vah, <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />ji deng ka gô, xôq apok Kơy Plêêk hnoq ik kahniq ka gô, đom varơuq luh huuy ku gô dii varơuq kôk xuum xôq đnooy vlôh varơuq kadook ku Hêêl Kaxay <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />(vii Hêêl Kaxay nưq đơu gô vlôh jêêk adro xatyauq katul đom looy tooy), xôq ka đom tuôôy nưq, gô hnoq ik kalh xuum padoh taboon tyauq đaji varơuq gô pheq đnooy.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Bơh xôq oh ay kung hnoq ik xet kaluh varơuq apiq truh gô, gô đong dơơp kajoq, yôôych Ti-chi-kơ, dro oh ay xung xiaq ji xapok muuyq xuum đom Lôôk, hnoq ăm oh ay xet tôôy varơuq, <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />ay nưq laa adro đơu gô heq patăk truh dii oh ay vii iq đinq neq, xôq oh ay hnoq ik xet đaleq truh 'wot ji xuum oh ay jah ahmưk nhăk.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Apôôy varơuq hrok hrol kahniq ka oh ay, kung dii xung xiaq ji xuum tuôq xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Apôôy vanong plêêk măn kung dêq hloay khơl adro xung xiaq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk haay, bơơn xung xiaq be hư hlơơp.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>